      "rerank_score_norm": 0.7068701436380759,
      "final_score": 0.8335112998476608,
      "text": "Our search strategy identified a total of 68 articles across the PubMed, Embase (Ovid) and CENTRAL databases. Following removal of 22 duplicates, 46 articles were screened by title and abstract, of which 32 were excluded. The remaining 14 articles had their full-texts assessed for eligibility. Five full-text articles were excluded, two reported the use of a bougie/stylet in an exchange manoeuvre, one reported the use of a stylet without laryngoscope and two did not report bougie/stylet efficacy outcomes at all. The nine remaining studies had their reference lists screened and a further four studies were identified and included. A total of 13 studies were therefore included in our qualitative synthesis [14-26]. Of these studies, 10 were included in our quantitative synthesis [14, 15, 19-26]. This study selection process has been summarised in a PRISMA flow chart (Fig. 1).",
      "images": []
